# Local answers stay local — except the screening example's PDF highlights,
# which ship so "Show markings from screening" has something to show.
annotations/**
!annotations/*/
!annotations/*/screening-marks-*.json
pdfs/*.pdf

# >>> SaiLoR (managed) >>>
# Not just tidiness: SaiLoR refuses to merge while an untracked file sits in
# the annotations/ folder, so one of these dropped there by the Finder or
# Explorer blocks every pull until somebody deletes it by hand.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
.*.swp
# <<< SaiLoR (managed) <<<
